      <title>特朗普威胁升级，加拿大报复性关税即将生效</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/world/canada/tariffs-trade-war-carney-trump.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[尽管华盛顿警告美国将征收新一轮关税，但加拿大预计将于周二开始征收高达 50% 的新关税。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/world/canada/tariffs-trade-war-carney-trump.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 20:36:13 GMT</pubDate>
