    <item>
      <title>迈阿密机场货运飞机失事后，官员们正在寻找答案</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/us/miami-airport-plane-crash.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这架为亚马逊运营的货机在劳动节周末冲进公路并撞上车辆，造成 5 人死亡，200 多个航班中断。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/us/miami-airport-plane-crash.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 20:03:06 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>关于迈阿密一架货机冲出跑道并造成 5 人死亡的信息</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/06/us/miami-plane-crash-what-we-know.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这架飞机是亚马逊货运机队的一部分，从波多黎各起飞。它冲出跑道后撞上了几辆车。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/06/us/miami-plane-crash-what-we-know.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 19:50:48 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
