    <item>
      <title>德国针对极右翼的“防火墙”正在经受前所未有的考验</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/world/europe/germany-afd-election-saxony-anhalt-election.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[极右翼的德国另类选择党在州选举中大获全胜，这表明选民对于是否坚持数十年来排挤极端分子的策略存在分歧。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/world/europe/germany-afd-election-saxony-anhalt-election.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 18:35:45 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>在德国取得胜利后，极右翼需要帮助才能掌权</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/world/europe/germany-afd-elections-bsw.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[德国另类选择党（AfD）并没有一条直接的道路来治理萨克森-安哈尔特州，但一个小型民粹主义政党可以扫清道路。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/world/europe/germany-afd-elections-bsw.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 18:31:52 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普的贸易战正在影响国会之争</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/us/trump-tariffs-iran-congress-colorado.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在科罗拉多州和全国各地，更高的成本、关税和廉价牛肉进口正在影响选民，他们将帮助决定明年哪个政党控制众议院。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/us/trump-tariffs-iran-congress-colorado.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 14:33:18 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
